      "message": "I\u0027d like to keep this discovery code with the other discovery code if possible. The reason this code repeatedly generates a host event, and the other discovery code doesn\u0027t is that the other discovery code sets `PE_FLAGS_VDM_SETUP_DONE` when discovery fails, and then this function checks `PE_FLAGS_VDM_SETUP_DONE` before running. This code should do that too.\n\nThe other discovery code also checks the discovery status before running the discovery states, and that would be acceptable here too, but it would be more verbose.",
